{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15913","headline":"元日早朝 · 王建","name":"元日早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大国礼乐备，万邦朝元正。\n东方色未动，冠劒门已盈。\n帝居在蓬莱，肃肃钟漏清。\n将军领羽林，持戟巡宫城。\n翠华皆宿陈，雪仗罗天兵。\n庭燎远煌煌，旗上日月明。\n圣人龙火衣，寝殿开旋扃。\n龙楼横紫烟，宫女天中行。\n六蕃倍位次，衣服各异形。\n举头看玉牌，不识宫殿名。\n左右雉扇开，蹈舞分满庭。\n朝服带金玉，珊珊相触声。\n泰阶备雅乐，九奏鸾凤鸣。\n裴回庆云中，竽磬寒铮铮。\n三公再献寿，上帝锡永贞。\n天明告四方，羣后保太平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}